Wingman Drone imp commands

==============================================================================================================
IMP PARAMS TO TRIGGER TO GET ALL TRUE

Parameter	Value	Meaning
EKF2_EV_CTRL	9	Enables selected external-vision fusion modes; the exact enabled measurements depend on PX4's bit definitions.
EKF2_HGT_REF	2	Selects the configured EKF2 height reference.
EKF2_EV_DELAY	50 ms	Compensation for external-vision measurement delay.
EKF2_EVP_NOISE	0.10	External-vision position measurement noise.
EKF2_EVV_NOISE	0.10	External-vision velocity measurement noise.
EKF2_EVA_NOISE	0.10	External-vision attitude measurement noise.
EKF2_GPS_CTRL	0	Disables GPS aiding in EKF2.

====================================================================================================================================

Final VLM commands working for now:


Terminal 1: Start PX4 SITL & Gazebo Simulator
Bash
cd ~/PX4-Autopilot
PX4_GZ_WORLD=maze_exploration PX4_GZ_MODEL_POSE="0,-17.2,0.3,0,0,1.5708" make px4_sitl gz_x500_gps_denied

Terminal 2: Start the Micro XRCE-DDS Agent
Bash
MicroXRCEAgent udp4 -p 8888


Terminal 3: Bridge the LiDAR Data
Bash
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/ws_ros2/install/setup.bash
source ~/ws_wingman/install/setup.bash
 ~/ws_wingman/scripts/bridge_lidar.sh '/world/maze_exploration/model/x500_gps_denied_0/link/link/sensor/lidar_2d_v2/scan' scan


Step 4: Camera bridge

Only needed for “find ...” missions.

bash
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/ws_ros2/install/setup.bash
source ~/ws_wingman/install/setup.bash
ros2 run ros_gz_bridge parameter_bridge '/world/maze_exploration/model/x500_gps_denied_0/link/camera_link/sensor/IMX214/image@sensor_msgs/msg/Image[gz.msgs.Image'



Step 5: Localization and mapping
bash
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/ws_ros2/install/setup.bash
source ~/ws_wingman/install/setup.bash
ros2 launch ~/ws_wingman/launch/maze_bringup.launch.py with_nav:=false lidar_frame:=link lidar_xyz:="0 0 0.075"

RViz opens and the map starts building.


Step 6: VLM warms up in the first minute
bash
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/ws_ros2/install/setup.bash
source ~/ws_wingman/install/setup.bash
ros2 launch wingman_exploration mission.launch.py vlm:=false takeoff_alt:=0.75



Step 7: VLM cli
bash
source /opt/ros/humble/setup.bash
source ~/ws_ros2/install/setup.bash
source ~/ws_wingman/install/setup.bash
 ros2 run wingman_vlm prompt_cli


